{
  "about": "Controlled value lists of the Wenzelsbibel edition, edited by hand. Each list names the element and attribute it governs and the Schematron rules in wenzelsbibel.sch that encode it, with \"all\" when the rule lists every value and \"data\" when it lists only the values with source data. A value has source handbook when the Transkriptionshandbuch names it, and source data when only the edition data uses it. Every list carries a German caption and every value a German label, each with a labelSource, which is handbook for the German wording of the Transkriptionshandbuch, wireframe for a label the wireframe shows, and working label for a plain descriptive label that awaits the edition team's confirmation. python editorial/check_fixtures.py --vocabulary fails when this file and the schema disagree, in a rule test or in a value list a message repeats, and when a caption or label is missing.",
